    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41378" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτλάω</span></b> , only aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέτλην,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear patiently, be patient,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶ τοι ἐπιτλήτω κραδίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.591
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶ τοι ἐπιτλήτω κραδίη μύθοισιν
				ἐμοῖσιν</span>
			<i>let</i> it <i>listen patiently to</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				19.220
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρί᾽ ἐπιτλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					241
				</span></i>
			.</div>
